senses.gloss:
(1) FERULA ASA-FOETIDA LINN. (Ainslie 1, p. 20; Dutt; Gul; HK;
Kav; MW; Nadk. 1, nr. 1023; PW; Vśs) = SCORODOSMA FOETIDUM
BUNGE (Dy, p. 385-389);
(2) F. FOETIDA REGEL (Avk; Bpn, p. 41; Chopra; DWH 2, p. 147-
152: used as a substitute; Nadk. 1, nr. 1023; Sanyal; Watt CP, p.
534-535) = F. SCORODOSMA BENTLEY ET TRIM. (Nadk. 1, nr. 1023);
(3) F. ALLIACEA BOISS. (Bpn, p. 41; Chopra; Dutt; DWH 2, p. 141-
147; Dy, p. 381-385; HK; Nadk. 1, nr. 1022; Vśs; Watt CP, p. 534);
(4) F. NARTHEX BOISS. (Bpn, p. 41; Chopra; Dgv, nr. 172; Dy, p.
385-389; KB 2, p. 1216-1218; Nadk. 1, nr. 1023; V 10, p. 64) =
NARTHEX ASAFOETIDA FALC. (KB 2, p. 1216-1218; V 10, p. 64);
(5) GARDENIA LUCIDA ROXB. (KB 2, p. 1278-1279: नाडीहिङ्गु,
हिङ्गुनाडिका);
(6) MELIA AZADIRACHTA LINN. = AZADIRACHTA INDICA A. JUSS.
(KB 1, p. 536-541).
